{"4155950": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "2x2=BOOM", "steam_appid": 4155950, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4155950/extras/186a38cc144738714cba39ca108a43b1.avif?t=1781640695\" width=1560 height=254 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In most games, math is boring. In 2x2=BOOM, it's your weapon.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Includes 2 Player Pilot/Gunner mode!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Extensive difficulty options to customize your experience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play your way: mouse, keyboard, controller, or any combination</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bonus challenges, unlockables, and high scores </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4155950/extras/b3d2a7e6182098ffab1ec049c2fdb8bb.poster.avif?t=1781640695\" width=718 height=380 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4155950/extras/b3d2a7e6182098ffab1ec049c2fdb8bb.webm?t=1781640695\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4155950/extras/b3d2a7e6182098ffab1ec049c2fdb8bb.mp4?t=1781640695\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4155950/extras/640a32b1d3b7df92ca2dddfc1c1d0a60.avif?t=1781640695\" width=1560 height=254 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're just starting to learn multiplication or already a master of numbers, 2x2=BOOM is built for players of all skill levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perfect for kids learning their tables, adults sharpening mental math, and arcade fans looking for a fresh twist on the shoot-’em-up genre.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4155950/extras/769caecaad988504e0043ac7c01a6153.avif?t=1781640695\" width=1560 height=254 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play with a controller, keyboard, or mouse — or mix and match however you like.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4155950/extras/f2ae89ea4ee2633e3da818e781f2debe.poster.avif?t=1781640695\" width=718 height=386 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4155950/extras/f2ae89ea4ee2633e3da818e781f2debe.webm?t=1781640695\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4155950/extras/f2ae89ea4ee2633e3da818e781f2debe.mp4?t=1781640695\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4155950/extras/3ed5c1527eca41e28ba194a7753e80e4.avif?t=1781640695\" width=1560 height=254 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every level offers more than survival. Complete special challenges to earn up to <strong>four medals</strong> per stage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you collect them all and truly master the game?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4155950/extras/0a3612f7ea980f1c23025e7de015878d.poster.avif?t=1781640695\" width=720 height=402 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4155950/extras/0a3612f7ea980f1c23025e7de015878d.webm?t=1781640695\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4155950/extras/0a3612f7ea980f1c23025e7de015878d.mp4?t=1781640695\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4155950/extras/186a38cc144738714cba39ca108a43b1.avif?t=1781640695\" width=1560 height=254 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In most games, math is boring. In 2x2=BOOM, it's your weapon.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Includes 2 Player Pilot/Gunner mode!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Extensive difficulty options to customize your experience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play your way: mouse, keyboard, controller, or any combination</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bonus challenges, unlockables, and high scores </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4155950/extras/b3d2a7e6182098ffab1ec049c2fdb8bb.poster.avif?t=1781640695\" width=718 height=380 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4155950/extras/b3d2a7e6182098ffab1ec049c2fdb8bb.webm?t=1781640695\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4155950/extras/b3d2a7e6182098ffab1ec049c2fdb8bb.mp4?t=1781640695\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 